 "description": "The new Swift Trawler 48 focuses on practical easy living and circulation and is built to seek new horizons.\nThis mid-range boat has a strikingly stylish profile which features the new stainless framed teak slat fashion plates - aligned with those seen on the Grand Trawler 62.",
