  {
   "kind": "interior-design",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "Andreani Design totally revisited the interior design and layout. A large fully-equipped L-shaped galley offers plentiful capacity for extended cruising.\nForward of the galley a spacious raised U-shaped dinette provides seating for up to 8 with great views all around.\nTo starboard the professional helm station has an adjacent side door for easy docking and circulation.\nIn the lower accommodation, the forward owner’s cabin features a double berth and plenty of storage. The en-suite bathroom includes a separate shower cubicle.\nThe port guest cabin has two single berths with an infill to make up a double berth. This cabin also features an en-suite door to the portside day head.\nThe starboard guest cabin has two portlights, a transverse double berth and a double door wardrobe that is large enough to take an optional washer/dryer in the base.\nThe hull windows and overheard hatches flood the cabins with natural light and cross ventilation.",
   "items": [],
